  "Question": "Segment \\(AB\\) is 6 cm long and parallel to the projection plane. The projection rays are perpendicular to the projection plane. What is the length of the orthographic projection of \\(AB\\)? (Unit: cm)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "6",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "When a segment is parallel to the projection plane, its orthographic projection is parallel and equal in length to the original segment, so its length remains 6 cm.",
